<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>ChatGPT on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/tags/chatgpt/</link><description>Recent content in ChatGPT on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 02:58:27 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/tags/chatgpt/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to Cancel a ChatGPT Plus Subscription and Stop Auto-Renewal</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/cachplsust.html</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 02:58:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/cachplsust.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;If you no longer want to continue a recurring ChatGPT Plus subscription, cancel it before the next billing date.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="cancel-chatgpt-plus-on-the-web"&gt;Cancel ChatGPT Plus on the Web&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#cancel-chatgpt-plus-on-the-web"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The web flow at the time of writing was:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Sign in to ChatGPT, select the account avatar, and choose &lt;code&gt;My plan&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;img src="https://releaseleaf.com/postImg/ChatGPT/cancel/1.jpg" alt="My plan" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Select &lt;code&gt;Manage my subscription&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;img src="https://releaseleaf.com/postImg/ChatGPT/cancel/2.jpg" alt="Manage subscription" decoding="async" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;On the current-plan page, select &lt;code&gt;Cancel subscription&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;img src="https://releaseleaf.com/postImg/ChatGPT/cancel/3.jpg" alt="Cancel subscription" decoding="async" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Confirm the cancellation.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;img src="https://releaseleaf.com/postImg/ChatGPT/cancel/4.jpg" alt="Confirm cancellation" decoding="async" loading="lazy"&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The interface may change over time. A survey may appear after cancellation; completing it is optional.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>